    "location": "html-block:6",
    "text": "Manufacturing for NBV has been discontinued. As an alternative, please refer BA300 for battery monitor application.",
    "heading": "NBV Voltage Unbalance Relay - Legacy"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:7",
    "text": "The NBVIIA relay is a high speed sensitive three-phase voltage unbalance relay which is capable of detecting a small voltage unbalance in a three-phase system. The NBVIIA when applied as a protective device is normally used in conjunction with a time-delay relay. One NBVIIA relay and one timing relay are required at each terminal.",
    "heading": "NBV Voltage Unbalance Relay - Legacy"
  },
